# Generated research data under reports/ stays local. On 2026-09-28 a single
# earlier commit had added 934 MB of it (panels, caches, exchange snapshots);
# it was stripped from the unpushed history before the first push. Keep the
# human-made parts (.md, .py, .ipynb, .png, small decision .json) tracked.
reports/**/*.csv
reports/**/*.csv.gz
reports/**/*.json.gz
reports/**/*.parquet
reports/**/*.bak
reports/**/*.log
reports/**/*.pkl
reports/**/cache/
reports/**/*_cache/
reports/**/exchange_info_snapshot.json
